INT. OAKHAVEN THRONE ROOM - MIDNIGHT - 1310

Winter winds howl against the stained glass. Shadows dance across the cold stone pillars.

GRAND INQUISITOR MALAKOR paces before the dais, reviewing the war tithes.

Suddenly, the oak doors burst open!

HIGH KING VALERIUS IV strides into the royal hall, eyes blazing with fury. In his right hand, he proudly brandishes the glowing Sun-Forged Blade of Eldor!

Beside him walks PRINCE KAELEN, having abandoned the royal quarters to join the vanguard.

HIGH KING VALERIUS IV
Inquisitor! Drop your weapons or taste the steel of Eldor!

GRAND INQUISITOR MALAKOR
Your Grace, how can this be?

Prince Kaelen steps forward, drawing his dagger to execute the King's decree in the year 1310.
